* User-supplied 6AL5 single-diode fit. A zero-volt sense source makes the
* current-dependent series drop explicit to ngspice's nodal solver.
.subckt UA176_6AL5 A K
VSENSE A ASENSE 0
* At the origin a small current offset bounds the fractional-power derivative.
BDROP ASENSE IDEAL V={pow(uramp(i(VSENSE)/.0032)+1e-9,.775)-pow(1e-9,.775)}
D1 IDEAL OFFSET UA176_6AL5_EXP
R2 IDEAL K 12.7G
V2 OFFSET K -.867
CAK A K 3.2p
.model UA176_6AL5_EXP D(IS=66p XTI=3.15 N=3.15 RS=0)
.ends UA176_6AL5
